# Keep every text file LF on checkout across platforms. The drivers under bin/
# and install.sh are `#!/usr/bin/env bash` scripts — a CRLF checkout (Windows
# autocrlf) breaks the shebang on Unix and the symlink install path. Pinning LF
# repo-wide keeps the shipped tool identical on macOS/Linux/Windows-Git-Bash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything genuinely binary should be marked so it is never normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
